Roland JV-1080 (Orchestral Expansion Card), Yamaha QY20 pocket sequencer, 432Hz-calibrated acoustic cello and viola ensembles, Roland Cloud TR-909 (soft-filtered), Korg M1 piano, EMU Proteus/1, brushed hi-hats, and passenger train field recordings.

